# .gitignore
# danielgarcia.it — files and folders that Git must never track
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Private working files live next to the code but are never published.

# Assistant context file, kept private
/CLAUDE.md

# Dated working documents, kept private
/private_doc/

# VS Code settings: paths specific to each workstation
/.vscode/

# Maven build output, including the generated site (target/roq)
/target/

# Front-end packages that the Quarkus Web Bundler installs (mvnpm, no Node).
# No leading slash: the Web Bundler's own check only accepts this form.
node_modules/
